WEBVTT

01:30.930 --> 01:34.960
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.960
[Episode 35]

01:39.400 --> 01:40.259
It appears to me

01:40.789 --> 01:42.390
that the gravest concern now

01:42.400 --> 01:44.640
is that the salt prices
are remaining too low.

01:44.640 --> 01:46.039
You can't just keep

01:46.590 --> 01:48.120
pushing yourself, can you?

01:49.430 --> 01:50.400
I plan to procure salt

01:50.400 --> 01:51.150
from Sichuan.

01:51.150 --> 01:51.590
Si-

01:52.400 --> 01:53.150
Sichuan?

01:54.150 --> 01:55.770
Sichuan well salt

01:55.870 --> 01:57.000
is certainly cheap,

01:57.590 --> 01:58.789
but you are

01:58.820 --> 02:00.280
waging a price war now.

02:01.930 --> 02:02.790
Are you

02:03.280 --> 02:04.720
looking to smuggle salt?

02:07.720 --> 02:09.830
It's hardly smuggling,

02:10.840 --> 02:13.040
since salt is a necessity shared by all.

02:14.240 --> 02:15.940
Decades ago, such remarks

02:16.190 --> 02:18.390
would be considered highly offensive.

02:18.520 --> 02:20.380
Don't you fear the death penalty?

02:20.400 --> 02:21.540
In 5 or 6 days,

02:22.079 --> 02:23.880
I'll lose my entire investment.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.630
We're having a discussion.

02:27.630 --> 02:28.690
Why did you come in?

02:28.800 --> 02:29.770
I'm close to being a widow.

02:29.770 --> 02:30.770
Can't I be here?

02:30.800 --> 02:31.310
Yu'er...

02:31.310 --> 02:32.310
Hold your tongue.

02:32.430 --> 02:33.090
Hear me out.

02:34.190 --> 02:34.650
Father,

02:35.520 --> 02:37.560
go back to Shanxi tomorrow without me.

02:37.560 --> 02:38.680
I'll stay with Pingyuan

02:38.680 --> 02:39.940
for the salt business.

02:40.120 --> 02:40.900
Nonsense!

02:41.360 --> 02:43.490
How's that going to put my mind at ease?

02:44.590 --> 02:46.320
Children are a constant source

02:46.800 --> 02:48.240
of worry for their parents.

02:48.240 --> 02:49.370
I'm as much bothered

02:49.800 --> 02:50.470
as you are.

02:53.910 --> 02:58.730
[Liangjiang Viceroy's Office]

03:00.240 --> 03:01.120
Mr. Genius!

03:04.000 --> 03:05.590
What was that shouting about?

03:05.590 --> 03:06.560
Come here.

03:07.910 --> 03:09.840
Let me show you something special.

03:14.660 --> 03:18.510
[Heaven-Sent Huai Salt]

03:15.470 --> 03:16.670
Heaven-sent Huai...

03:19.590 --> 03:21.079
What a sturdy bag.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.160
[Heaven-Sent Huai Salt]

03:23.960 --> 03:25.400
Didn't you ask me to check out

03:25.400 --> 03:26.470
those two hotheads'

03:26.470 --> 03:27.900
initial moves?

03:28.430 --> 03:29.360
Gu Pingyuan

03:29.400 --> 03:30.630
is quite resourceful.

03:30.630 --> 03:32.960
He's giving away these salt bags for free.

03:33.800 --> 03:35.140
Whoever buys salt from his shop

03:35.140 --> 03:35.670
gets one,

03:36.430 --> 03:38.490
with complimentary repair service.

03:42.240 --> 03:42.840
Well...

03:45.070 --> 03:47.440
[Good Fortune Refined Salt]

03:45.560 --> 03:46.920
Look at this.

03:59.870 --> 04:01.710
Such well ground salt.

04:03.670 --> 04:04.300
Look.

04:05.150 --> 04:05.880
Regular salt

04:07.010 --> 04:08.670
costs 300 coppers per bundle.

04:08.840 --> 04:10.440
Such resifted salt sells for

04:10.800 --> 04:12.130
500 coppers per bundle.

04:13.430 --> 04:14.430
Families of modest means

04:14.430 --> 04:15.470
all opt for this kind of salt

04:15.470 --> 04:16.800
to keep up appearances.

04:18.360 --> 04:20.160
Then I guess Gu is selling

04:20.510 --> 04:21.680
below cost.

04:22.390 --> 04:23.190
Such salt is priced

04:23.190 --> 04:25.540
at 700 to 800 coppers per bundle
north of the river.

04:25.540 --> 04:26.200
By the way,

04:27.190 --> 04:28.520
how much does Li Million

04:28.560 --> 04:29.070
charge?

04:32.760 --> 04:34.090
200 coppers per bundle?

04:35.120 --> 04:36.159
Interesting.

04:36.360 --> 04:37.950
I truly admire you.

04:41.159 --> 04:44.600
You're a real genius like the historically
renowned strategist Zhuge Liang

04:44.600 --> 04:46.650
who restored peace with brilliant schemes.

04:46.650 --> 04:47.250
Cut it out.

04:47.440 --> 04:48.600
Making the business work

04:48.600 --> 04:50.659
without spending a single copper...

04:52.000 --> 04:53.000
This Gu fellow

04:54.000 --> 04:55.460
does have some real stuff.

04:55.560 --> 04:58.630
As long as
there's sufficient grain and salt

04:59.190 --> 05:00.070
for the people,

05:00.800 --> 05:02.560
there will be no unrest.

05:04.040 --> 05:05.300
I knew these two people

05:05.600 --> 05:06.280
would

05:06.310 --> 05:07.970
definitely go for a showdown.

05:08.690 --> 05:09.720
But at the moment,

05:10.610 --> 05:12.650
it's still unclear who will win.

05:14.050 --> 05:18.610
[A salt field]

05:39.800 --> 05:40.750
Your Excellency.

05:40.750 --> 05:42.140
What before your eyes

05:42.190 --> 05:43.720
are inkstone-style salt troughs.

05:43.720 --> 05:46.250
Many of them are relics
from the Song Dynasty.

05:46.680 --> 05:47.630
That means...

05:47.750 --> 05:49.950
they have a history
of over 900 years, right?

05:49.950 --> 05:50.510
Exactly.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.560
However, nowadays,

05:51.560 --> 05:52.600
we no longer adopt the traditional method

05:52.600 --> 05:54.390
of boiling seawater to make salt.

05:54.390 --> 05:55.320
Look over there.

05:55.630 --> 05:57.120
We source mud from beaches,

05:57.120 --> 05:58.190
let it dry in the sun,

05:58.190 --> 05:59.430
pour seawater over it,

05:59.430 --> 06:01.000
and put it through a filter
for high-concentration brine.

06:01.000 --> 06:01.940
Then, the brine

06:02.000 --> 06:03.600
is poured into these troughs

06:03.630 --> 06:05.720
for sun exposure,
followed by proper cooking,

06:05.720 --> 06:07.120
until salt is separated.

06:08.190 --> 06:09.160
How large a salt field

06:09.160 --> 06:10.480
is needed to produce this amount

06:10.480 --> 06:11.070
of salt?

06:11.390 --> 06:12.400
Less than 4 mu.

06:12.750 --> 06:13.500
This is the best salt field

06:13.500 --> 06:14.900
in the Lianghuai region.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.240
The salt produced here tastes excellent,

06:17.240 --> 06:18.440
and the yield is high.

06:21.800 --> 06:24.130
Are all of them specialized salt workers?

06:24.930 --> 06:26.040
The older ones are.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.360
As for the younger ones,

06:27.360 --> 06:28.690
they learn as they train

06:28.750 --> 06:29.730
apprentices.

06:29.760 --> 06:31.290
We're still short-handed.

06:32.360 --> 06:33.960
How much do they get paid?

06:34.480 --> 06:35.810
Four strings per month.

06:36.040 --> 06:36.870
Food, lodging,

06:36.870 --> 06:37.630
and medical care

06:37.630 --> 06:38.430
are provided.

06:39.720 --> 06:41.120
With such scorching sun,

06:41.310 --> 06:43.240
that's not much of an ideal salary.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.770
I suggest a pay raise.

06:45.750 --> 06:46.880
His Excellency here

06:47.000 --> 06:48.930
has ordered a pay raise for you!

06:49.560 --> 06:51.320
Your Excellency is brilliant!

06:51.360 --> 06:52.690
Thank Your Excellency!

06:53.430 --> 06:55.530
All hail Your Excellency!

06:55.560 --> 06:56.600
Your Excellency is amazing!

06:56.600 --> 06:57.800
Your Excellency is brilliant!

06:57.800 --> 06:59.130
Thank Your Excellency!

06:59.310 --> 07:01.950
-Thank Your Excellency!
-You treat the people as your children.

07:01.950 --> 07:02.410
Sir,

07:02.510 --> 07:04.960
you're really like a parent to the people.

07:05.230 --> 07:06.880
It seems I do enjoy a good reputation

07:06.880 --> 07:07.830
in Liangjiang.

07:10.720 --> 07:11.240
Sir.

07:12.070 --> 07:13.260
Frankly speaking,

07:13.950 --> 07:15.720
the workers here are already paid

07:15.720 --> 07:17.390
more than those in any other salt field

07:17.390 --> 07:18.850
in the Liangjiang region.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.310
Now, Gu Pingyuan and I

07:20.310 --> 07:21.970
are actually selling at a loss

07:22.160 --> 07:23.270
for publicity.

07:24.000 --> 07:24.630
We would

07:25.800 --> 07:27.310
appreciate it if you could lower the tax

07:27.310 --> 07:28.170
on salt fields.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.600
Is the tax on salt fields high?

07:31.600 --> 07:32.750
How come I don't know that?

07:32.750 --> 07:34.159
It's 400,000 taels of silver a month.

07:34.159 --> 07:35.760
Don't you think that's high?

07:35.830 --> 07:37.159
Four hundred thousand?

07:37.950 --> 07:39.810
It's actually not a large figure.

07:40.000 --> 07:40.700
With 400,000 taels,

07:40.700 --> 07:42.159
much can be accomplished.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.600
I've just petitioned

07:44.070 --> 07:45.750
the imperial court to exempt Liangjiang

07:45.750 --> 07:47.150
from taxes for two years.

07:47.630 --> 07:48.980
This money will be used

07:49.159 --> 07:51.159
to boost the vitality of Liangjiang.

07:51.159 --> 07:53.270
You're here all the time,
so you don't know—

07:53.270 --> 07:54.530
in Nanjing, where I reside,

07:54.530 --> 07:57.240
I see the region growing more prosperous
day by day.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.040
In the future,

07:58.070 --> 07:59.510
I'll make sure you are properly recognized

07:59.510 --> 08:00.910
for your contributions.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.730
Let's go up and take a look.

08:10.870 --> 08:11.770
How's it going?

08:12.000 --> 08:13.330
Has your father come to?

08:18.000 --> 08:18.750
Shall we

08:18.800 --> 08:20.400
raise the salt prices again?

08:21.600 --> 08:23.270
I really can't stand being patronized

08:23.270 --> 08:24.870
by this old weasel every day.

08:25.510 --> 08:25.970
I agree.

08:26.360 --> 08:28.220
Let's raise the prices together.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.350
I thought you'd beg me.

08:30.560 --> 08:32.690
Why would I beg you to raise the prices?

08:32.830 --> 08:33.320
Okay.

08:33.789 --> 08:34.850
If you're onboard,

08:34.909 --> 08:35.770
I'll go with it.

08:36.260 --> 08:38.190
Let's see who knocks who out first.

08:41.400 --> 08:43.059
Please come over, gentlemen!

08:43.150 --> 08:44.200
Let's take a photo
with this Western stuff!

08:44.200 --> 08:45.430
Time for a photo!

08:45.480 --> 08:46.860
Mr. Li, come here.

08:47.080 --> 08:47.940
Mr. Gu, come.

08:48.600 --> 08:49.920
Let's take a picture.

09:18.240 --> 09:19.040
God of Wealth!

09:19.650 --> 09:20.240
Coming!

09:22.080 --> 09:23.410
Mr. Gu, your reputation

09:23.410 --> 09:24.600
is growing by the day.

09:24.600 --> 09:25.550
In Jiangsu and Zhejiang,

09:25.550 --> 09:26.840
your name's mentioned on a daily basis.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.030
You're really something.

09:28.030 --> 09:28.890
It feels so cool

09:29.180 --> 09:30.240
here in your cabin.

09:30.330 --> 09:31.060
Cool, right?

09:32.390 --> 09:33.290
The secret's over there.

09:33.290 --> 09:33.950
Take a look.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.530
What a smart way to make ice.

09:54.790 --> 09:56.190
I must say, God of Wealth,

09:56.320 --> 09:58.100
you're really living an immortal's life.

09:58.100 --> 09:59.340
That's not true.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.870
Having spiritual powers makes one a god,

10:00.870 --> 10:02.120
and being carefree makes one an immortal.

10:02.120 --> 10:04.200
Which of those standards
do you think I've met?

10:04.200 --> 10:05.540
Stop flattering me.

10:05.750 --> 10:06.860
Take a seat now.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.800
Have some lotus root and fruits.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.370
They've just been chilled.

10:10.480 --> 10:11.150
Settle down,

10:11.150 --> 10:12.150
and we'll drink later.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.030
That can wait.

10:13.390 --> 10:13.910
Well,

10:14.270 --> 10:15.800
have the ships arrived yet?

10:16.710 --> 10:18.170
Look at you, so impatient.

10:20.510 --> 10:22.240
I've got them prepared for you.

10:23.600 --> 10:24.430
Exactly

10:24.510 --> 10:25.880
16 ships.

10:26.870 --> 10:28.400
Good thing I own a draft bank

10:28.840 --> 10:31.000
and charter ships year-round
to transport raw silk.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.130
People other than me

10:32.510 --> 10:34.440
may not be able to secure
these many ships.

10:34.440 --> 10:35.170
In that case,

10:35.360 --> 10:36.430
I owe you many thanks.

10:36.430 --> 10:37.530
Alright, alright.

10:37.720 --> 10:38.320
Be seated.

10:41.890 --> 10:44.310
I heard that recently in Liangjiang,

10:44.360 --> 10:46.000
salt merchants have been racking

10:46.000 --> 10:46.670
their brains

10:46.670 --> 10:48.600
for issues regarding salt fields.

10:50.510 --> 10:51.510
I suggest you not worry too much

10:51.510 --> 10:52.870
about winning or losing.

10:52.870 --> 10:53.930
At such a young age,

10:54.110 --> 10:55.550
you're already a well-matched rival

10:55.550 --> 10:56.530
for Li Million.

10:56.910 --> 10:58.840
That's a remarkable achievement itself.

10:58.840 --> 11:00.840
Even if you're forced onto the back foot,

11:00.840 --> 11:02.290
that won't be your fault.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.390
Don't let

11:03.390 --> 11:04.210
this matter

11:04.270 --> 11:05.670
affect your health.

11:06.670 --> 11:07.220
I've been pushed

11:07.220 --> 11:08.840
this far by the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

11:08.840 --> 11:09.820
In fact,

11:10.150 --> 11:11.240
Rui Lin never intended

11:11.240 --> 11:12.890
to let Li Wantang manage
the Lianghuai salt business.

11:12.890 --> 11:14.670
He just set me up to take on the latter.

11:14.670 --> 11:16.760
What happened later—
stabilizing salt prices,

11:16.760 --> 11:17.720
taking action against rice merchants,

11:17.720 --> 11:19.600
and that trouble concerning the Li family—

11:19.600 --> 11:21.060
was all instigated by him.

11:21.750 --> 11:23.210
The Viceroy of Liangjiang

11:23.320 --> 11:25.160
is nicknamed the Wringer.

11:25.270 --> 11:26.240
Even if he saw the King of Hell,

11:26.240 --> 11:28.440
he'd wring every last copper out of him.

11:28.910 --> 11:30.970
I must warn you of this—

11:31.630 --> 11:32.690
stay cautious

11:32.790 --> 11:33.980
in the salt trade.

11:34.200 --> 11:36.270
It concerns many interested parties.

11:36.270 --> 11:37.600
I've done everything

11:37.630 --> 11:38.560
I can to help you.

11:38.870 --> 11:39.730
As for the rest,

11:39.870 --> 11:41.730
I'm not sure what exactly I can do.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.630
Thank you for the kind reminder, Mr. Wu.

11:44.630 --> 11:45.270
Butler!

11:48.000 --> 11:48.750
How's my father?

11:48.750 --> 11:49.480
Young Master,

11:49.480 --> 11:50.640
Master is still in a coma.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.100
The problem is I can't wait

11:52.120 --> 11:53.050
till he comes to!

11:53.960 --> 11:55.050
If anything goes wrong...

11:55.050 --> 11:56.360
I'll take full responsibility.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.930
It's not your money at stake anyway.

11:57.930 --> 11:59.790
This is a very tense situation.

11:59.810 --> 12:01.670
What are you still dawdling for? Go!

12:01.670 --> 12:02.120
Fine.

12:02.150 --> 12:03.480
I'll go check on Master.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.080
His Excellency

12:10.240 --> 12:11.870
demands the salt field taxes

12:12.120 --> 12:13.320
be paid right on time.

12:13.550 --> 12:14.610
Before I came back,

12:14.670 --> 12:16.320
I had just settled the payment.

12:16.320 --> 12:16.840
The monthly

12:16.840 --> 12:18.870
tax bill of over 400,000 taels of silver

12:18.870 --> 12:19.810
is like a knife

12:19.840 --> 12:21.370
pressed against my throat.

12:21.510 --> 12:22.370
That really...

12:22.840 --> 12:23.570
feels awful.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.010
Alright.

12:26.150 --> 12:27.350
Enough said about me.

12:27.390 --> 12:28.600
Tell me how you've been.

12:28.600 --> 12:30.400
Any problems in doing business?

12:30.910 --> 12:31.750
We're faring well

12:31.750 --> 12:32.910
in business.

12:33.440 --> 12:34.270
The problem is

12:34.910 --> 12:37.110
the current salt prices are far too low,

12:37.550 --> 12:38.670
while the taxes are excessively high.

12:38.670 --> 12:40.360
Even if you owned a silver mine,

12:40.360 --> 12:42.090
you'd be drained financially.

12:45.030 --> 12:47.410
I think it's time to shut down
these two silk shops

12:47.410 --> 12:48.130
in Tianjin.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.360
They're tying up too much money,

12:49.360 --> 12:51.020
while yielding thin profits.

12:51.840 --> 12:52.510
Young Master,

12:52.510 --> 12:54.510
they bring in an annual revenue
of hundreds of thousands of taels.

12:54.510 --> 12:55.750
You call that "thin profits"?

12:55.750 --> 12:57.030
Do you even know the meaning

12:57.030 --> 12:57.870
of "thin profits"?

12:57.870 --> 12:59.720
I definitely know better than you do.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.670
When these shops are closed,

13:00.670 --> 13:02.150
and the properties
and inventory liquidated,

13:02.150 --> 13:03.200
we'll at least gain hundreds

13:03.200 --> 13:04.320
of thousands more taels.

13:04.320 --> 13:04.910
Hands off!

13:04.910 --> 13:06.040
You can't do this!

13:06.150 --> 13:07.080
How am I going to explain

13:07.080 --> 13:08.320
to Master when he wakes up?

13:08.320 --> 13:09.750
Who's in charge of the Li family now,

13:09.750 --> 13:10.790
you or me?

13:11.600 --> 13:13.250
Definitely not me.

13:13.440 --> 13:14.600
But is pouring money into this

13:14.600 --> 13:16.330
non-stop really the solution?

13:16.550 --> 13:17.760
I think it's better

13:17.790 --> 13:19.120
to bribe the officials.

13:19.120 --> 13:20.390
That way,
you get to keep some money for yourself,

13:20.390 --> 13:21.600
and things will go more smoothly.

13:21.600 --> 13:23.440
If I give this money to the officials,

13:23.440 --> 13:25.500
will they stop taxing my salt fields?

13:34.440 --> 13:36.440
I'm closing these two tea shops too.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.430
Young Master,

13:37.600 --> 13:39.130
you really must not do this.

13:39.750 --> 13:41.000
You know what business

13:41.000 --> 13:41.860
Master does.

13:42.000 --> 13:43.480
It's not worthwhile
to sustain the salt fields

13:43.480 --> 13:45.750
at the cost
of his most significant ventures!

13:45.750 --> 13:46.470
Doing so

13:46.720 --> 13:47.720
will make you a...

13:47.870 --> 13:49.270
A real spendthrift.

13:49.270 --> 13:51.000
Is it what you were going to say?

13:51.720 --> 13:52.520
Young Master,

13:53.120 --> 13:54.880
I didn't mean any of that.

13:54.910 --> 13:56.560
I don't care what you meant.

13:56.870 --> 13:57.870
Right now, every month,

13:57.870 --> 13:59.270
I'm required to pay 400,000 taels

13:59.270 --> 14:00.320
in salt field taxes.

14:00.320 --> 14:01.200
I have people to feed, horses to maintain,

14:01.200 --> 14:02.150
clerks to hire, managers to pay—

14:02.150 --> 14:03.080
so many expenditures!

14:03.080 --> 14:04.550
I'm hemorrhaging money every month.

14:04.550 --> 14:06.320
If my father wakes up and finds out

14:06.320 --> 14:07.670
I've lost the salt fields,

14:07.670 --> 14:09.080
what do you think he'll make of this?

14:09.080 --> 14:10.570
I'll have to obediently

14:10.600 --> 14:12.840
return to the capital
and study for the rest of my life.

14:12.840 --> 14:14.240
I'll never be allowed to do business

14:14.240 --> 14:14.910
again!

14:15.840 --> 14:17.120
So, I'm telling you,

14:18.000 --> 14:19.260
I must win this battle!

14:19.360 --> 14:20.090
Understood?

14:20.670 --> 14:21.720
Master has come to!

14:21.720 --> 14:22.780
Master has come to!

14:23.720 --> 14:24.840
Master has come to...

14:24.840 --> 14:25.900
Master has come to!

14:27.150 --> 14:28.520
Come on, drink up.

14:42.630 --> 14:44.160
No need to panic, everyone.

14:44.960 --> 14:46.360
Everything will be fine as I said.

14:46.360 --> 14:46.910
Boss.

14:54.730 --> 14:55.340
Mr. Tu,

14:55.720 --> 14:56.780
what is this about?

14:58.410 --> 14:59.600
Do tell us what trick you have

14:59.600 --> 15:00.460
up your sleeve.

15:03.020 --> 15:03.750
Come with me.

15:03.750 --> 15:04.150
No, no.

15:04.360 --> 15:05.140
What are you doing?

15:05.140 --> 15:06.270
I didn't do anything.

15:06.270 --> 15:08.470
It's not like I'm going to eat you alive.

15:08.670 --> 15:10.070
I just want to take you out

15:10.080 --> 15:11.280
and show you the salt.

15:11.360 --> 15:11.840
Heizi.

15:18.830 --> 15:20.480
Father, it's me, Li Qin.

15:20.840 --> 15:22.300
Would you like some water?

15:22.750 --> 15:23.390
Master,

15:23.750 --> 15:24.870
The salt fields have been

15:24.870 --> 15:26.670
causing financial losses to us.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.750
Why bring this up?

15:33.720 --> 15:34.630
Come with me.

15:37.320 --> 15:38.550
My father is seriously ill.

15:38.550 --> 15:39.750
To save my father's life,

15:39.750 --> 15:40.750
I'd never hesitate to forfeit

15:40.750 --> 15:41.480
all family assets,

15:41.480 --> 15:42.320
let alone some shops.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.850
So drop this topic for good.

16:16.750 --> 16:18.350
Lift the cloth and show them.

16:29.510 --> 16:30.080
This...

16:31.120 --> 16:32.200
Take a good look.

16:33.010 --> 16:34.210
Put the cover back on!

16:36.600 --> 16:37.480
Move!

16:41.670 --> 16:42.900
That's a lot of salt.

16:42.920 --> 16:43.480
Yeah.

16:43.510 --> 16:44.550
I guess it's even more than

16:44.550 --> 16:45.270
all our stock.

16:45.270 --> 16:46.270
-Indeed.
-Right.

16:49.150 --> 16:49.870
Boss,

16:50.240 --> 16:52.140
where did this salt come from?

16:56.150 --> 16:57.050
Tell them.

17:00.720 --> 17:01.560
This salt

17:01.790 --> 17:03.630
wasn't sourced in Lianghuai.

17:03.790 --> 17:06.520
It's well salt
delivered from Sichuan and Yunnan

17:08.430 --> 17:10.980
by horse gangs and waterways.

17:18.089 --> 17:18.630
Boss,

17:19.089 --> 17:20.890
you're dealing in illegal salt.

17:21.550 --> 17:23.010
That's a capital offense.

17:28.590 --> 17:29.200
Everyone,

17:30.680 --> 17:32.140
in business at this level,

17:32.470 --> 17:34.000
who isn't risking his life?

17:34.270 --> 17:35.670
In such difficult times,

17:36.440 --> 17:37.700
working with all of you

17:38.030 --> 17:39.000
is my honor.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.790
I was reluctant to tell you the truth

17:42.790 --> 17:43.480
because I was concerned

17:43.480 --> 17:45.070
that if the government investigated,

17:45.070 --> 17:46.550
you would all be implicated.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.550
Now, I've told you

17:48.400 --> 17:49.750
the trick I have up my sleeve.

17:49.750 --> 17:51.350
As for what path to take next,

17:51.590 --> 17:52.720
please decide for yourselves.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.920
I won't force anyone.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.030
Boss,

17:56.750 --> 17:57.680
we're so blessed

17:58.110 --> 17:59.240
to be taken in by you.

17:59.830 --> 18:01.750
For that, we're truly grateful.

18:02.110 --> 18:03.170
But this matter...

18:09.830 --> 18:10.690
How about this?

18:10.960 --> 18:12.790
Let it be the last risk we take.

18:14.510 --> 18:17.030
We'll bear all potential consequences
together.

18:17.030 --> 18:17.560
At worst,

18:17.590 --> 18:19.050
when we're done with this—

18:19.110 --> 18:20.400
we'll have some savings by then—

18:20.400 --> 18:22.070
we'll close our shops to put an end

18:22.070 --> 18:22.930
to everything.

18:23.440 --> 18:25.160
It's unnecessary to fight Li Wantang

18:25.160 --> 18:26.490
over short-term gains.

18:28.400 --> 18:29.730
Don't worry about that.

18:30.640 --> 18:32.310
You must be tired from the journey.

18:32.310 --> 18:33.770
Get home and get some rest.

18:33.830 --> 18:34.880
Tomorrow morning,

18:34.880 --> 18:36.210
escort your boats back.

18:49.240 --> 18:49.920
Young Master,

18:49.920 --> 18:50.980
there's a finding.

18:54.960 --> 18:55.560
What is it?

18:56.000 --> 18:57.200
Our men spent a long time observing

18:57.200 --> 18:57.880
each salt shop

18:57.880 --> 18:58.880
in the salt guild.

18:59.310 --> 19:00.520
They discovered that before dawn,

19:00.520 --> 19:01.880
packs of salt carried by big ships

19:01.880 --> 19:03.380
would arrive at the dock.

19:03.680 --> 19:04.960
Our men followed the ships

19:04.960 --> 19:05.750
and found the salt

19:05.750 --> 19:06.750
wasn't sourced locally.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.310
Most of it was well salt from Sichuan.

19:08.310 --> 19:08.920
Well salt?

19:09.880 --> 19:10.680
How many shipments?

19:10.680 --> 19:11.880
Deliveries were made day and night.

19:11.880 --> 19:13.940
Last time, there were 16 large ships.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.750
Well salt costs less than half of ours.

19:15.750 --> 19:17.410
No wonder they can keep going.

19:20.110 --> 19:21.060
I was wondering

19:22.510 --> 19:24.710
why he dared to enter a price war with me.

19:24.920 --> 19:26.130
I'm merely hanging on

19:26.160 --> 19:27.160
by selling shops,

19:27.960 --> 19:29.560
while he remains unscathed.

19:32.920 --> 19:33.920
Go get the butler.

19:34.110 --> 19:34.550
Yes.

19:39.590 --> 19:40.790
When Master wakes up,

19:40.880 --> 19:41.880
we'll let him decide.

19:41.880 --> 19:42.470
No need.

19:42.680 --> 19:44.270
My father is too weak now.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.750
he shouldn't be bothered
with these matters.

19:46.750 --> 19:47.750
Besides, he's not keeping us around

19:47.750 --> 19:49.310
so we can be dead weight, right?

19:49.310 --> 19:49.770
Tell me.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.200
Do you have a plan?

19:53.070 --> 19:55.150
Gu Pingyuan smuggles a large amount

19:55.400 --> 19:56.720
of salt at a time.

19:56.960 --> 19:58.480
This is a capital offense.

20:02.030 --> 20:03.760
Anything wrong, Young Master?

20:03.790 --> 20:06.050
You want to report it to the authorities?

20:07.030 --> 20:08.640
How foolish of you.

20:09.790 --> 20:11.390
Now, it is known to everyone

20:11.410 --> 20:12.360
in Liangjiang

20:12.440 --> 20:14.550
that Gu Pingyuan is heavily favored

20:14.590 --> 20:16.200
by the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.600
Who would dare touch him?

20:18.110 --> 20:19.920
Maybe the Viceroy's Office is going to

20:19.920 --> 20:22.180
reward him for stabilizing salt prices.

20:24.400 --> 20:24.860
Listen.

20:27.030 --> 20:27.830
To my recollection,

20:27.830 --> 20:29.630
when we first came to Jiangning,

20:29.680 --> 20:30.810
we sent generous gifts

20:30.810 --> 20:32.400
to the Canal Gang, didn't we?

20:32.400 --> 20:34.680
Now, these people have come in handy.

20:35.200 --> 20:36.010
Tell them

20:36.110 --> 20:37.640
to seize this shipment of salt

20:37.640 --> 20:38.830
that Gu Pingyuan is expecting

20:38.830 --> 20:39.960
as soon as possible.

20:40.110 --> 20:41.350
If he boldly demands it back,

20:41.350 --> 20:42.350
seize him too.

20:42.590 --> 20:44.120
Under such circumstances,

20:44.440 --> 20:46.590
Gu Pingyuan won't dare
to ask the authorities for help.

20:46.590 --> 20:48.790
He'll have to swallow this bitter pill.

20:49.510 --> 20:50.480
That's the first task.

20:50.480 --> 20:51.270
Second,

20:52.400 --> 20:54.610
notify all our shops nationwide

20:54.680 --> 20:56.170
to transfer all their funds here.

20:56.170 --> 20:58.240
I'll finish Gu off while he's down.

20:59.440 --> 21:00.550
I don't believe I'll lose again.

21:00.550 --> 21:02.070
The time has come for Gu Pingyuan

21:02.070 --> 21:05.270
and me to see who's better
through this salt competition.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.550
Carry out the tasks now.

21:39.480 --> 21:40.410
Stop your boats!

21:43.070 --> 21:43.720
Halt!

21:44.750 --> 21:45.880
Stop your boats now,

21:45.960 --> 21:47.360
or we'll set them on fire!

21:51.110 --> 21:51.720
Everyone,

21:52.030 --> 21:52.490
what...

21:52.720 --> 21:53.920
what's going on here?

21:53.970 --> 21:57.380
[Canal Gang]

22:30.880 --> 22:31.480
Mother.

22:33.480 --> 22:35.350
Why are your eyes so red?

22:37.000 --> 22:38.600
Did you not sleep last night?

22:39.160 --> 22:39.720
I...

22:40.920 --> 22:42.360
I must've got so tired

22:42.880 --> 22:43.940
that I fell asleep.

22:46.240 --> 22:47.720
How long have I been out?

22:50.400 --> 22:52.260
For... over 10 days.

22:53.480 --> 22:54.260
Mother.

22:56.270 --> 22:57.670
Are you really awake now?

23:02.150 --> 23:04.410
I know what happened in the past few days.

23:06.440 --> 23:07.920
You gave me bed baths

23:08.640 --> 23:10.140
and fed me medicine.

23:12.790 --> 23:14.590
Yet I just couldn't open my eyes.

23:17.270 --> 23:19.070
I wasn't even able to move

23:19.110 --> 23:20.000
my fingers.

23:21.960 --> 23:23.240
I was like a bug

23:23.680 --> 23:25.110
trapped in glue.

23:26.200 --> 23:28.200
I yelled "no" as loud as I could.

23:31.750 --> 23:33.380
Then I asked this guy

23:33.830 --> 23:35.850
to at least let me

23:36.160 --> 23:37.620
bid farewell to my family.

23:40.030 --> 23:41.240
He fell silent,

23:43.240 --> 23:44.880
and I felt that I could move.

23:48.350 --> 23:48.960
Who...

23:49.920 --> 23:51.000
was that guy?

23:52.070 --> 23:53.790
Maybe he was God,

23:58.400 --> 23:59.200
or

23:59.200 --> 24:00.550
an educated man.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.310
Who cares who he was?

24:05.110 --> 24:05.680
Mother.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.410
You must've had a bad dream.

24:12.070 --> 24:13.600
Kid, you don't understand.

24:17.270 --> 24:20.240
The real bad dream is being awake.

24:23.510 --> 24:24.510
When I was asleep,

24:26.350 --> 24:27.880
everything was clear to me.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.940
Where is Pingyuan?

24:37.720 --> 24:39.780
He... went out for business.

24:41.110 --> 24:43.240
I need to tell you something.

24:44.720 --> 24:46.240
Listen carefully.

24:49.400 --> 24:50.160
Do not demand

24:52.070 --> 24:53.550
a man seek fame,

24:54.720 --> 24:56.180
as long as he's ambitious.

24:57.270 --> 24:58.980
Do not demand a man be smart,

25:00.790 --> 25:02.450
as long as he's kind-hearted.

25:03.830 --> 25:05.240
In chaotic times,

25:07.880 --> 25:10.340
being together matters more than anything.

25:10.920 --> 25:11.790
You get it?

25:15.160 --> 25:15.760
Mother...

25:18.000 --> 25:19.400
Why are you saying this?

25:21.720 --> 25:23.440
When I first lied down,

25:25.200 --> 25:27.240
I wished I could die immediately.

25:31.590 --> 25:33.650
I slowly came to realize everything,

25:36.510 --> 25:38.920
but unfortunately, it was too late.

25:44.440 --> 25:44.900
Father,

25:45.720 --> 25:47.790
why did you suddenly fall ill?

25:51.680 --> 25:52.480
This is fate.

26:00.750 --> 26:02.510
Are you and Gu Pingyuan

26:02.590 --> 26:04.390
still neck and neck in business?

26:05.550 --> 26:07.070
Maybe yesterday we were.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.760
But after today,

26:09.030 --> 26:09.880
that won't be the case.

26:09.880 --> 26:10.920
I had the Canal Gang

26:10.920 --> 26:11.960
seize his goods.

26:13.550 --> 26:14.660
You have no idea.

26:14.960 --> 26:16.110
He adopted the tactics

26:16.110 --> 26:17.440
of illegal salt dealers

26:17.640 --> 26:18.380
and smuggled

26:18.510 --> 26:20.510
cheap well salt from Sichuan for sale.

26:20.510 --> 26:22.070
No wonder
he dared to wage a price war against me

26:22.070 --> 26:23.400
and has not lost ground.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.370
Shame on him.

26:26.070 --> 26:27.880
Business is just business.

26:29.110 --> 26:30.880
What you've done is unethical.

26:34.200 --> 26:34.660
That...

26:35.510 --> 26:35.980
Father,

26:36.030 --> 26:36.720
why are you suddenly

26:36.720 --> 26:37.680
talking about ethics with me?

26:37.680 --> 26:39.160
Remember what you taught me?

26:39.160 --> 26:40.270
One shouldn't do business

26:40.270 --> 26:41.440
if he cares much about ethics.

26:41.440 --> 26:42.880
You said nothing is more important than

26:42.880 --> 26:44.750
accomplishing what I set my mind to.

26:44.750 --> 26:46.810
Why the sudden talk about ethics now?

26:46.880 --> 26:48.030
And where is this mercy

26:48.030 --> 26:49.160
for him coming from?

26:50.750 --> 26:53.440
The salt industry
is the lifeline of Lianghuai.

26:54.400 --> 26:56.800
Though it's entirely under my control now,

26:57.750 --> 26:59.350
I've never thought of

26:59.440 --> 27:01.000
monopolizing it.

27:02.350 --> 27:04.410
Neither should you ever expect that.

27:05.310 --> 27:07.640
If we cut off the livelihood of Lianghuai,

27:08.400 --> 27:11.330
our family will become
a target of public criticism.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.240
Son,

27:15.550 --> 27:18.080
don't go to the extremes
when you do business.

27:19.310 --> 27:20.000
Gu Pingyuan

27:20.000 --> 27:21.930
isn't doing business for himself.

27:23.030 --> 27:24.310
He's trying to leave Jiangnan

27:24.310 --> 27:25.550
a chance of survival.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.680
Capturing half of the market

27:31.680 --> 27:32.920
is good enough for us.

27:37.110 --> 27:38.440
As for the Canal Gang...

27:39.640 --> 27:41.440
tell them to back off right away.

27:42.790 --> 27:44.650
We have to steer clear of trouble.

27:55.240 --> 27:56.340
Father, please

27:56.400 --> 27:57.830
get well soon

27:57.880 --> 27:58.720
and take back

27:58.750 --> 27:59.950
the business from me.

28:02.350 --> 28:03.880
The young master's actions

28:04.200 --> 28:05.480
are truly surprising.

28:08.640 --> 28:10.570
Haven't you noticed he's changed?

28:13.480 --> 28:14.550
People

28:15.640 --> 28:17.880
with a knife want to kill,

28:18.590 --> 28:20.830
with power want to act,

28:21.480 --> 28:22.480
and with money,

28:23.550 --> 28:25.400
there's nowhere in the world

28:25.400 --> 28:26.600
they don't want to go.

28:27.480 --> 28:29.880
These three things are the most dangerous.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.590
Now that he's taken over the business,

28:33.590 --> 28:35.190
he would inevitably change.

28:37.720 --> 28:39.780
I've managed to step away from it all.

28:42.200 --> 28:43.200
Just let him be.

28:43.400 --> 28:44.000
Master,

28:44.440 --> 28:45.640
you're disheartened

28:45.640 --> 28:47.070
only because of the illness.

28:47.070 --> 28:48.270
When you recover, all family affairs

28:48.270 --> 28:49.930
will still be yours to decide.

28:50.200 --> 28:52.000
Who am I to do that?

28:53.270 --> 28:55.100
My life is coming to an end.

28:55.680 --> 28:58.340
What's the point
of holding onto all this money?

28:59.640 --> 29:01.590
For the name of "Li Million,"

29:03.200 --> 29:04.750
I've owed too many debts.

29:08.960 --> 29:09.880
You may go now.

29:11.110 --> 29:12.030
I need a rest.

30:16.480 --> 30:17.430
Mr. Gu,

30:17.590 --> 30:19.120
the boats have been seized!

30:19.160 --> 30:20.170
Mr. Gu,

30:20.440 --> 30:21.970
the boats have been seized!

30:22.000 --> 30:23.530
The boats have been seized!

30:23.580 --> 30:32.540
[Qingjiangpu Pier]

30:25.030 --> 30:26.160
The ship's arrived!

30:26.720 --> 30:27.580
Where are they?

30:29.790 --> 30:30.310
Look,

30:30.480 --> 30:31.240
that man receives guests

30:31.240 --> 30:32.350
on behalf of the Canal Gang.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.830
That table's reserved for them.

30:33.830 --> 30:34.440
It's where

30:34.480 --> 30:36.410
they usually have tea and discuss.

30:39.680 --> 30:40.780
I am Gu Pingyuan.

30:40.920 --> 30:42.380
May I meet with your chief?

30:43.160 --> 30:43.980
What for,

30:44.160 --> 30:46.020
a personal matter or a gang issue?

30:46.030 --> 30:47.090
A personal matter.

30:47.200 --> 30:48.530
For the salt shipments.

30:58.000 --> 30:59.200
Will there be danger?

31:00.590 --> 31:01.250
I guess not.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.160
If anything happens,

31:03.160 --> 31:03.830
I'll try

31:03.880 --> 31:05.340
every means to rescue you.

31:14.480 --> 31:15.590
Chief has invited you,

31:15.590 --> 31:17.480
an honored guest, to the hall for tea.

31:17.480 --> 31:17.940
Please.

31:21.310 --> 31:22.370
He's invited.

31:22.590 --> 31:23.460
You're not.

31:44.140 --> 31:47.680
[Canal Gang]

31:55.680 --> 31:56.200
Please.

32:01.070 --> 32:02.000
I pay my respects

32:04.480 --> 32:05.510
to you... Chief.

32:11.310 --> 32:19.470
[Hall of Loyalty]

32:35.600 --> 32:37.440
These shipments of salt are yours?

32:37.440 --> 32:37.880
Yes.

32:39.240 --> 32:40.670
Selling illegal salt

32:41.070 --> 32:42.920
is quite a serious offense.

32:43.110 --> 32:44.910
It's a matter of the government.

32:45.000 --> 32:46.240
Speak from your position, please.

32:46.240 --> 32:48.000
You're a straight shooter then.

32:48.000 --> 32:48.850
The Canal Gang

32:48.920 --> 32:52.200
has hundreds of thousands of members
along the Grand Canal,

32:52.200 --> 32:54.160
who have been struggling
to make ends meet

32:54.160 --> 32:55.030
in these rough times.

32:55.030 --> 32:55.820
So,

32:56.550 --> 32:58.900
we'd like to borrow some money from you.

32:59.720 --> 33:01.310
Now, I offer you two options.

33:01.310 --> 33:02.350
Make your choice.

33:03.790 --> 33:06.070
The first one is,
for every future shipment

33:06.070 --> 33:07.000
of illegal salt,

33:07.350 --> 33:09.210
we demand additional 30% profit.

33:09.480 --> 33:10.670
We guarantee

33:10.880 --> 33:11.740
that your ships

33:11.750 --> 33:13.550
will safely arrive at the docks.

33:14.070 --> 33:14.960
We will be friends

33:14.960 --> 33:16.120
for a long term.

33:19.300 --> 33:21.500
[Hall of Loyalty]

33:19.480 --> 33:21.550
The second option is more straightforward—

33:21.550 --> 33:23.550
pay 20 million taels of silver

33:23.750 --> 33:25.400
for a chance of survival.

33:26.240 --> 33:27.840
An outright abduction it is.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.590
Don't you fear
if I report it to the authorities?

33:29.590 --> 33:30.350
Report it?

33:31.480 --> 33:33.340
If you dare to let the authorities

33:33.880 --> 33:35.000
know about your salt smuggling,

33:35.000 --> 33:35.800
then go ahead.

33:36.830 --> 33:37.720
Let me be clear.

33:38.160 --> 33:40.220
I will not pay you a single penny more.

33:40.440 --> 33:41.640
Abduct me if you want.

33:54.920 --> 33:56.850
Bring me 20 million taels of silver

33:57.030 --> 33:57.740
in 3 days.

33:58.350 --> 33:59.280
If I don't see

33:59.310 --> 34:00.370
this money by then,

34:00.480 --> 34:02.790
I'll shove you into a pig cage
and sink you,

34:02.790 --> 34:04.030
so you'll be fish feed.

34:04.030 --> 34:05.230
I always keep my word.

34:08.440 --> 34:08.690
[Hall of Loyalty]

34:10.710 --> 34:11.310
[Canal Gang]

34:14.670 --> 34:16.150
Chief has his own rules.

34:16.360 --> 34:18.159
Trying to barge into the hall...

34:18.190 --> 34:19.150
Do you have a death wish?

34:19.150 --> 34:20.810
I don't care what hall that is!

34:26.300 --> 34:27.900
What good is brute strength?

34:28.110 --> 34:29.360
Being all brawn and no brains

34:29.360 --> 34:30.690
won't get you anywhere.

35:14.630 --> 35:15.330
Madam!

35:16.590 --> 35:18.260
Mr. Gu has been kidnapped!

35:18.840 --> 35:19.960
Madam!

35:29.670 --> 35:30.480
Good grief!

35:31.280 --> 35:32.340
What are you doing?

35:32.550 --> 35:33.440
Going for a fight?

35:33.440 --> 35:35.150
Why haven't you changed your clothes yet?

35:35.150 --> 35:36.510
You look like an old master.

35:36.510 --> 35:38.240
Why should I change my clothes?

35:39.170 --> 35:40.840
Didn't you hear what Heizi said?

35:40.840 --> 35:42.550
They've kidnapped your son-in-law

35:42.550 --> 35:44.000
and are demanding
20 million taels of silver.

35:44.000 --> 35:44.960
How can we raise that much money?

35:44.960 --> 35:46.590
Go change your clothes quickly.

35:46.590 --> 35:48.710
Do you still have your fighting dagger?

35:48.710 --> 35:50.710
You want the two of us
to storm in their place?

35:50.710 --> 35:52.480
Have you let the operas
get into your head?

35:52.480 --> 35:53.760
I don't have the abilities

35:53.760 --> 35:55.620
of that legendary hero Dou Erdun!

35:55.880 --> 35:56.440
Father,

35:56.920 --> 35:58.160
what's the matter?

35:58.320 --> 35:58.900
We've been

35:58.900 --> 36:00.230
extorted before.

36:00.510 --> 36:01.920
We'll play by the rules, negotiate,

36:01.920 --> 36:03.280
and resort to violence
only if a consensus can't be reached.

36:03.280 --> 36:04.810
How can we be afraid of them?

36:05.510 --> 36:06.370
How about this?

36:06.590 --> 36:07.880
Keep this robe on to conceal

36:07.880 --> 36:09.550
the fighting clothes you're in.

36:09.550 --> 36:10.400
Let's hide our iron fists

36:10.400 --> 36:11.630
with velvet gloves.

36:11.930 --> 36:12.590
Chances are

36:12.670 --> 36:13.800
that they won't be alert around you.

36:13.800 --> 36:14.840
You then intimidate them with a strike,

36:14.840 --> 36:15.460
and I'll handle the rest.

36:15.460 --> 36:16.110
How does that sound?

36:16.110 --> 36:17.310
It's a terrible idea!

36:17.510 --> 36:18.420
The Canal Gang

36:18.440 --> 36:19.590
has hundreds of thousands of members.

36:19.590 --> 36:21.720
Can they be subdued by one strike only?

36:21.880 --> 36:22.920
To avoid imminent danger,

36:22.920 --> 36:24.630
maybe they will release Pingyuan.

36:24.630 --> 36:26.110
But after that,
it'll be much more difficult

36:26.110 --> 36:27.910
to ship items on the Grand Canal.

36:28.110 --> 36:30.440
It's not like we're demanding
lost goods back now.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.840
That's the least of my concern!

36:31.840 --> 36:33.280
Heizi said

36:33.510 --> 36:34.520
they'd drown him

36:34.550 --> 36:36.150
unless we paid in 3 days!

36:36.280 --> 36:37.440
If I wait till you devise a proper plan,

36:37.440 --> 36:39.710
it'll be too late
to even collect his body!

36:39.710 --> 36:40.190
Yu'er!

36:40.840 --> 36:42.560
T-This is a serious matter.

36:42.670 --> 36:44.190
I have told Pingyuan

36:44.280 --> 36:45.810
not to deal in illegal salt!

36:46.000 --> 36:47.330
Look what has happened.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.760
We can't report this to the authorities.

36:48.760 --> 36:51.290
Getting him back by force
is not the solution.

36:52.030 --> 36:52.690
It's better

36:53.190 --> 36:54.640
for us to find a mediator

36:54.670 --> 36:56.110
to reconcile both sides.

36:56.480 --> 36:58.790
I know quite a few notable figures

36:58.880 --> 36:59.960
in the Canal Gang.

37:00.280 --> 37:01.930
I've asked someone influential

37:01.930 --> 37:03.190
to speak on our behalf.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.670
What are you doing here?

37:11.670 --> 37:13.270
You should be recuperating.

37:14.330 --> 37:15.370
When I left,

37:15.400 --> 37:16.480
Gu Pingyuan asked me to find someone

37:16.480 --> 37:17.190
to save him.

37:17.320 --> 37:19.380
I went looking but she wasn't around.

37:19.400 --> 37:20.400
I wanted to ask...

37:21.190 --> 37:22.280
if I should go again.

37:22.280 --> 37:23.450
You silly child!

37:23.710 --> 37:24.590
Who did he ask you to find?

37:24.590 --> 37:26.320
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

37:27.030 --> 37:28.030
Why are you looking at her?

37:28.030 --> 37:28.710
Say it now!

37:28.760 --> 37:29.920
A life is in danger!

37:30.590 --> 37:31.360
It's a Ms. Su

37:31.360 --> 37:32.620
in Marshal Jiu's camp.

37:37.800 --> 37:38.780
You look down on me.

37:38.780 --> 37:40.440
You look down on me, don't you?

37:40.440 --> 37:41.230
Su can save him,

37:41.230 --> 37:42.310
but I can't?

37:42.590 --> 37:43.190
Are you going or not?

37:43.190 --> 37:44.250
I will if you don't!

37:44.590 --> 37:45.050
Out of my way!

37:45.050 --> 37:46.290
Off you go!

37:47.960 --> 37:48.440
Yu'er,

37:48.440 --> 37:50.300
can't you put yourself together?

38:29.800 --> 38:31.590
Incense smoke rises from the burner.

38:31.590 --> 38:34.000
Three elders and four young masters
sit in the hall.

38:34.000 --> 38:35.880
This humble fellow offers incense

38:35.880 --> 38:38.190
and begs for a meeting with Chief.

38:38.360 --> 38:40.030
Here I hold another burner
before my chest.

38:40.030 --> 38:42.590
The three elders and four young masters
beam with joy.

38:42.590 --> 38:44.110
My mentor comes
and takes the seat of honor,

38:44.110 --> 38:47.440
as this humble disciple lights incense
to pay his respects.

38:47.920 --> 38:49.920
May I have your name, sir?

38:50.230 --> 38:51.360
My surname is Chang.

38:51.360 --> 38:52.590
I am the fourth child in my family.

38:52.590 --> 38:53.920
Above me, it's the "Tong" generation.

38:53.920 --> 38:55.550
Below me, it's the "Wan" generation.

38:55.550 --> 38:57.610
As for me, I'm in the "Wu" generation.

38:58.480 --> 39:00.030
You are a respected senior then.

39:00.030 --> 39:02.170
Could you tell me who your mentor is?

39:02.230 --> 39:03.510
A son dare not speak his father's name.

39:03.510 --> 39:06.190
I learned from a gentleman
of the "Tong" generation.

39:06.190 --> 39:07.650
I've come with my daughter

39:07.840 --> 39:10.360
to discuss matters about her husband.

39:11.590 --> 39:12.050
Please.

39:22.840 --> 39:23.480
Boss Gui,

39:23.980 --> 39:25.840
Chang Si pays his respects to you.

39:28.920 --> 39:29.590
Mr. Chang,

39:30.840 --> 39:32.280
the senior member of the "Tong" generation
you mentioned

39:32.280 --> 39:33.210
has spoken to me.

39:33.880 --> 39:35.590
You're here to save your son-in-law,

39:35.590 --> 39:36.720
Gu Pingyuan, right?

39:36.800 --> 39:37.600
Yes, exactly.

39:38.760 --> 39:40.760
He smuggles salt on the Grand Canal,

39:40.840 --> 39:41.920
but refuses

39:42.320 --> 39:43.400
to share profits with his helpers

39:43.400 --> 39:44.050
along the way.

39:44.050 --> 39:45.310
It's unfair, isn't it?

39:45.670 --> 39:46.210
What?

39:46.710 --> 39:48.240
Do we not deserve to be paid?

39:48.440 --> 39:50.550
But there are rules in place.

39:51.190 --> 39:52.400
My son-in-law is acting on

39:52.400 --> 39:54.190
orders from the Viceroy of Liangjiang

39:54.190 --> 39:56.410
to revitalize Lianghuai salt fields.

39:56.480 --> 39:58.680
He's not trading salt for private gain.

39:59.400 --> 40:00.070
Boss Gui,

40:00.630 --> 40:01.890
I hope you understand.

40:01.920 --> 40:02.670
Don't try to pressure me

40:02.670 --> 40:04.870
with the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office.

40:04.960 --> 40:06.360
Those filthy rich officials

40:06.360 --> 40:07.730
are rolling in money,

40:07.960 --> 40:09.890
while my brothers in the Canal Gang

40:10.480 --> 40:11.590
have to buy their own shoes

40:11.590 --> 40:13.190
when they wear them out running.

40:13.190 --> 40:14.000
If you have a complaint,

40:14.000 --> 40:15.150
take it to the authorities.

40:15.150 --> 40:16.320
I'd like to see who dares to interfere

40:16.320 --> 40:17.380
when this blows up.

40:18.510 --> 40:19.910
The Canal Gang possesses

40:20.150 --> 40:23.210
a dragon-headed scepter
awarded by Emperor Qianlong.

40:23.510 --> 40:24.840
If this gets out of hand,

40:25.590 --> 40:26.840
I don't mind

40:26.880 --> 40:29.140
talking it out in the government office.

40:29.920 --> 40:31.960
But that senior member
of the Tong generation...

40:31.960 --> 40:32.310
[Hall of Loyalty]

40:34.670 --> 40:36.320
I have hundreds of thousands of mouths

40:36.320 --> 40:36.840
to feed!

40:36.840 --> 40:38.030
You think I'd care about
some senior member?

40:38.030 --> 40:39.170
Go home right now

40:39.280 --> 40:40.000
and raise the money.

40:40.000 --> 40:40.590
Do you understand?

40:40.050 --> 40:42.200
[Hall of Loyalty]

40:41.400 --> 40:44.190
-Go raise the money!
-Raise the money!

40:51.630 --> 40:53.270
Let's go home.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.730
This is a tough problem.

40:54.960 --> 40:55.670
You've seen it yourself.

40:55.670 --> 40:57.000
This is no place for you.

40:57.590 --> 40:58.070
Let's go.

40:58.070 --> 40:59.650
How is my husband doing?

40:59.800 --> 41:00.700
His condition

41:00.760 --> 41:01.920
depends on the amount of money

41:01.920 --> 41:02.780
you'll give us.

41:04.190 --> 41:04.880
I have...

41:06.360 --> 41:07.220
I have a hairpin

41:07.230 --> 41:09.580
that's worth a million.

41:09.920 --> 41:12.230
I'll leave it here with you as collateral.

41:12.230 --> 41:13.110
Can you make sure

41:13.110 --> 41:14.310
he gets proper meals?

41:14.710 --> 41:15.230
Yu'er,

41:15.630 --> 41:16.150
you can't give it away.

41:16.150 --> 41:16.630
That's...

41:16.630 --> 41:18.490
A hairpin that's worth a million?

41:18.800 --> 41:19.800
I've never seen one.

41:19.800 --> 41:20.800
Let me take a look.

41:32.880 --> 41:33.410
Boss Gui,

41:34.190 --> 41:35.440
can you bring him out

41:35.440 --> 41:36.740
so I can see him?

41:36.960 --> 41:37.490
I...

41:38.110 --> 41:39.000
need to ask him

41:39.030 --> 41:40.360
where he hid the silver.

41:41.480 --> 41:42.320
Sounds good.

41:42.840 --> 41:44.840
This kidnapping is paying off well.

41:45.360 --> 41:45.920
Guys!

41:46.230 --> 41:47.590
Bring that Gu fellow here.

41:47.590 --> 41:51.310
[Hall of Loyalty]

41:47.670 --> 41:48.330
-Yes.
-Yes.

42:05.550 --> 42:06.030
Pingyuan!

42:06.030 --> 42:06.630
Mr. Chang.

42:06.710 --> 42:07.580
Why are you here?

42:07.580 --> 42:08.440
Where is Ms. Su?

42:08.800 --> 42:09.910
Yu'er was worried about you,

42:09.910 --> 42:11.170
so we came first.

42:11.760 --> 42:12.920
Father and I risked our lives

42:12.920 --> 42:13.760
to come to your rescue,

42:13.760 --> 42:14.800
yet you asked about her
the moment you saw us.

42:14.800 --> 42:15.110
No.

42:15.150 --> 42:16.280
What can you do here?

42:16.400 --> 42:17.110
You're not able

42:17.110 --> 42:18.370
to solve this problem.

42:18.510 --> 42:19.590
Don't you see I'm worried about you?

42:19.590 --> 42:20.850
Why can't I be here?

42:20.880 --> 42:22.140
Enough. Stop arguing!

42:22.320 --> 42:23.580
I can't believe you two

42:23.630 --> 42:25.110
are quarreling at my place.

42:25.110 --> 42:25.880
Now, ask him

42:26.030 --> 42:27.190
where he hid the silver.

42:27.190 --> 42:28.590
There's no silver at all.

42:29.000 --> 42:29.510
What?

42:31.110 --> 42:32.040
No silver at all?

42:32.800 --> 42:33.480
Then I guess

42:33.510 --> 42:35.240
it's time to teach you a lesson.

42:35.280 --> 42:35.630
Guys!

42:35.670 --> 42:37.760
[Hall of Loyalty]

42:35.880 --> 42:37.800
Pierce his collarbones with an iron chain!

42:37.800 --> 42:38.600
Please don't!

42:38.710 --> 42:39.320
Let's talk it...

42:39.320 --> 42:41.230
You're having his collarbones pierced?

42:41.230 --> 42:41.840
Yes.

42:42.150 --> 42:44.280
I'll have it done right in front of you.

42:45.490 --> 42:46.950
Let me tell you what's good

42:47.000 --> 42:48.030
about this hairpin.

42:48.030 --> 42:48.450
Sure.

42:48.480 --> 42:49.410
Tell me about it.

42:53.480 --> 42:53.920
Look,

42:54.110 --> 42:54.570
just...

42:56.670 --> 42:57.840
Take her down!

42:57.920 --> 42:58.450
Back off!

42:58.480 --> 43:00.020
Shut up and stay back,

43:00.400 --> 43:01.440
or I'll have his right collarbone

43:01.440 --> 43:02.230
pierced too!
